# The release /download/current/ means on this host, moved with each release:
# on the release server the one being staged, which it redirects to (see
# release.conf, `map $host $download_release`); on reactome.org and beta the one
# they serve, which they proxy (common/download-site.conf), as
# `reactome.org 98;` or `beta.reactome.org 98;`. One line, for this host's name.
release.reactome.org 99;
